        "how_to_tell_apart": "DVT causes swelling and calf pain without spreading redness or fever, and compression ultrasound shows a clot."
      }
    ],
    "pearls": [
      "Redness of both legs is rarely cellulitis; think of stasis dermatitis first."
    ],
